<title>UK: EU grants free mkt wheat/barley/rye in 1st tender.</title>
<headline>EU grants free mkt wheat/barley/rye in 1st tender.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The European Union on Thursday granted the following licences to export free market grain to non-EU countries in its first export tender of the new 1997/98 season, the UK's Home Grown Cereals Authority said.</p>
<p>		  Tonnage	  Maximum rebate</p>
<p>Wheat	   105,000	   0.87  Ecu/tonne</p>
<p>Barley	   70,000	  14.92  Ecu/tonne</p>
<p>Rye		 1,000	  23.19  Ecu/tonne</p>
<p>--Christopher Lyddon, London newsroom +44 171 542 7928</p>
</text>
